            <div xml:id="d55">

                <pb facs="0069" n="57" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg57"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/23406: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Afghanistan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-09-03T22:00:00-04:00">September 3,
                            1942—10 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>36. While demands elsewhere and other considerations render improbable adoption
                    of the proposal contained in your 49 of August 7, 10 p.m., the matter is under
                    consideration and if a decision is reached in accordance with your
                    recommendation you will be notified immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
